st, producing a no-op or churn change."],"severity":"critical","suggested_fix":"Restate the defect as: the box fixture forwards os.environ['PATH'] verbatim into a rendered fixture value, so any secret embedded in PATH can leak on failure; then scope the fix to sanitizing/wrapping that PATH carry-over, and re-verify the sentinel reproduction injects the sentinel into PATH.","tier":"LLM","validity":1.0,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"na","asserted_capability_confirmed":"yes","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"na","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"yes","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"no","evidence_entails_finding":"yes","impact_follows_necessarily":"yes","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"yes","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"yes","path_reachable":"yes","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"yes","severity_claim_justified":"yes"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"none","blast_radius":"local","debt_impact":"low","divergent_implementation":"contradicts_reality","dod_uncertifiable":"certification_cannot_prove","internal_conflict":"none","irreversible_without_rationale":"none","likelihood":"high","prod_impact":"none","reversibility":"easy","silent_vs_self_revealing":"silent","undecomposed":"none","vague_directive":"none"}}},{"block_threshold":0.8,"blocking_enabled":true,"checklist_item":"- [ ] Reference ADR 0041 (allowlist-first-then-redact sanitization) as prior art and justify why the fixture 'representation-safe wrapper' (repr redaction) is chosen over — or is consistent with — the repo's established allowlist-first-fail-closed posture.","cohort":["T1"],"criteria":["T1"],"decision":"dropped","decision_margin":-0.8,"drop_reason":null,"evidence":["Plan: 'Change the fixture boundary to pass only required environment variables or use a representation-safe wrapper'","docs/adr/0041-llm-diagnostic-sanitization.md: 'Sanitization ... is allowlist-first, then redact' and 